$EPIK Airdrop Claim Criteria

1) EPIK Holders: we will be releasing a vault in the next 48hrs with @pantheonvaults. Here stakers of EPIK will be rewarded with more EPIK. They can also receive rewards from vetted projects wanting to partner with myself, my shows and my newsletter. Claims will begin from September 1st and continue monthly.

2) @YEET: any user will be able to claim who has deposited to YEET using a SOL wallet address. Minimum YEET volume of $1000 will apply. Claim will linked to sending deposit address. Non-CEX.

3) @RektMkts: any user who has signed up to rekt mkts pro. Claim will be linked to email address.

4) @RektCoin: we will be releasing a way to link a SOL address for REKT holders. This will only be for large holders so minimum REKT holding will apply. 

5) Social: I will be selecting best posts on X each day Claim will be linked to X handle. Multiple posts by the same user can be selected. They will be announced weekly on @educkcoin.

6) We will be airdropping larger holders of select other SOL communities including $ANSEM (as I feel like he led this movement), as well as anyone I see doing cool shit around EPIK

I'm essentially giving away free money that I have bought back with my own funds here. 

I have tried to do this as fair as possible. 

Some of these things may be changeable if I feel I have made a mistake. This is the first airdrop claim too so any kinks I will change for subsequent airdrops. 

Hopefully its a nice stimi for people who have supported me.

I will be announcing further token utility in the coming weeks.

